resolution: "Consolidated duplicated SDK export/assertion inventories around the shipped public-surface snapshot, focused guides and registry ownership map. Preserved all SDK exports, runtime files, declarations, documentation headings and substantive transaction/context safety contracts; corrected the context-evaluation example with a typed budget-refusal guard."
