actual_result: "Canonical sandboxed coverage passes 10,163 tests across 798 files with exact statements 68097/68097, branches 52238/52238, functions 14040/14040 and lines 64757/64757. Typecheck and all static subgates pass after planning-field and typed-edge repairs, including graph/record assurance and mutation controls. All 40 SDK guide headings remain and the typed documentation adapter compiles against packed declarations. Latest source/pre-closure archives pass unchanged base 19995781/20000000 bytes and real offline Sentry-injected 20239937/20250000 bytes with 1655 first-party and 4731 runtime files. Post-closure changelog/archive validation belongs to the reviewed delivery, not a publication claim."
