  "2026-10-11T16:36:43.639Z","harness:codex","Consolidated duplicated export and assertion inventories into the shipped API snapshot, focused guide routing and a registry ownership map. All SDK subpaths, declarations, runtime files and documentation anchors remain. Transaction recovery, preview safety, schema evolution and context semantics remain documented. Publication byte ceilings are unchanged."
  "2026-10-11T16:39:33.370Z","harness:codex","Packed artifact now passes the unchanged base budget: first-party distribution 19994516/20000000 bytes with 1655/1800 files; bundled runtime 23334884/25000000 bytes with 4731/5000 files. SDK exports, declarations and runtime closure remain shipped. Documentation links pass. Final reviewed changelog will also be included in the artifact receipt before closeout."
  "2026-10-11T17:53:47.388Z","harness:codex","Final source verification: canonical sandboxed coverage (--maxWorkers=8 --retry=1) passed 10,163 tests in 798 files; exact statements 68097/68097, branches 52238/52238, functions 14040/14040 and lines 64757/64757. Full TypeScript check passed. The independent installed-package grammar census is 233/233, zero findings, 20/21 shapes. Pre-closure archives containing the latest SDK guide and calendar declarations pass unchanged base 19,995,781/20,000,000 bytes and real offline Sentry-injected 20,239,937/20,250,000 bytes, preserving 1655 first-party and 4731 runtime files. Blocking tracker-quality metadata findings have been repaired through pm; final complete static execution and post-closure generated-changelog archives are still pending, so these are source/pre-closure receipts rather than publication claims."
  "2026-10-11T18:12:46.934Z","harness:codex","Reviewed-delivery completion receipts: latest upstream pm-changelog 2026.10.5 generates and checks the four new entries under Unreleased, preserving prior release buckets. Final generated-changelog archives pass unchanged base 19996491/20000000 and real offline Sentry-injected 20240647/20250000 first-party byte ceilings; both retain all 1655 distribution and 4731 runtime files. Final tarball passes Node 24.21/26.9 and Bun 1.4.2 metadata/provenance/no-op/admission/CLI/history acceptance, public calendar signature checks and strict documentation TypeScript compilation. Live required Sentry/telemetry gate passes: 14-day Sentry critical/high/total 0/0/0, 7-day finish error rate 2.92%, missing failure codes 0. Validation is successful with inherited 170 historical resolution-field warnings; all four new closures contain immutable resolution/expected/actual evidence. No in-progress items remain. Hosted exact-head review/checks and merge are still pending, and public 2026.10.11 acceptance remains prior-release channel evidence."
